# tools/resource_order.ledger -- the build-time order check's baseline.
# docs/SAVE-SCHEMA-SPEC.md, 'The build-time order check'. One line per
# resource-array entry and per script variable, in order:
#   A <slot> <array> <array name>
#   E <slot> <array> <position> <entry name>
#   O <slot> <owner array> <owner position> <owner name>
#   V <slot> <owner array> <owner position> <ordinal> <ident> <type>
# (owner array -1, position -1 is the module-level variable list)
# Never edit by hand: after a LEGAL append run
#   tools/check_resource_order.sh --record
# It refuses anything but an append, and writes no file otherwise.
